flowchart TB
  T[Authorized test client / test VM] -->|SSH 2222; Telnet 2223 opt-in; HTTP 8080| HP
  subgraph PI[Raspberry Pi 4 or 5 - isolated lab sensor]
    HP[Cowrie emulated shell + separate HTTP decoy]
    NIC[eth0 traffic arriving at Pi]
    IDS[Suricata passive capture and SYN observations]
    A[Unprivileged collector + bounded disk spool]
    RAW[Rotated raw logs + session recordings]
    NIC --> IDS
    HP --> RAW
    IDS --> RAW
    RAW --> A
  end
  T -->|TCP probes including closed ports| NIC
  A -->|Pinned TLS + per-device token; event batches and heartbeat| ING
  subgraph CP[Laptop - control plane]
    ING[Reverse proxy :8443 + FastAPI ingestion]
    W[Single writer: validate, deduplicate, correlate, detect]
    DB[SQLite WAL + raw archive + evidence manifests]
    ML[Versioned rules + Random Forest + Isolation Forest]
    API[Authenticated API + resumable SSE stream]
    UI[React + TypeScript dashboard]
    ING --> W
    W <--> ML
    W --> DB
    DB --> API
    API --> UI
  end
  UI -->|Case export request| API
  API --> E[Bounded export job: ZIP evidence + PDF report]
